		"Delay: Time, Feedback"
	],
	"notice": "Most controls are MIDI receive mappings. The unmodified hardware has no MIDI output and cannot send panel movements or notes to Harmoneasy. Enable MIDI RX ShortMessage. Filter Peak has no CC assignment.  GUI controls generate MIDI into the chain; route that chain to a MIDI output to control the hardware. DIN devices normally appear under the MIDI interface name, so select the profile manually. Unmapped physical buttons and switches have stable SVG IDs for future bindings. Positions are schematic. Note surfaces use virtual defaults; use MIDI learn to match the hardware octave or configuration.",
